itation is successful, the attacker might try to maintain access to the system. This could involve installing backdoors, creating new user accounts, or escalating privileges. The goal is to ensure that the attacker can regain access to the system even if the initial vulnerability is patched. Tools like `Meterpreter` (part of Metasploit) can be used for post-exploitation activities."}
